 '第四站 · 行為測試':'Stop 4 · Behaviour test','轉折：BERT 選字時，真的用上了嗎？':'Twist: does BERT actually use this when it chooses a word?',
 '我們把每句的修飾語換成 [MASK]，只比較 BERT 對四個字的機率。如果它真的懂這些差別，應該遠勝過「只看名詞最常配哪個字」這種土法煉鋼的方法。':'We replace the modifier with [MASK] and compare BERT’s probabilities for the four words. If BERT really understood the differences, it should easily beat a low-tech rule: “pick whichever word this noun usually takes”.',
 'BERT，完整語境':'BERT, full context','只看名詞的搭配統計（不用任何模型）':'Noun collocation counts only (no model)','BERT，只給名詞':'BERT, noun only',
 '探針雖能從模型的中高層表徵中解碼「老」的時間參照，但此資訊未穩定反映於模型的遮蔽填空選擇，顯示表徵中的可解碼資訊不必然等同於模型預測時實際利用的資訊。':'Although probes can decode the time reference of 老 from the model’s middle and upper layers, this information is not consistently reflected in its masked fill-in choices — information that is decodable from a representation is not necessarily the information the model uses when it predicts.',
