 '探針機率為五折交叉驗證的樣本外預測，共收錄 384 句（全部 169 句「舊」，及原、前、老的抽樣）。訓練前已在訓練折內扣除各修飾語的平均向量，所以探針讀到的是同一個字在不同語境中的差異，而不是字本身。':'Probe probabilities are out-of-sample predictions from 5-fold cross-validation over 384 sentences (all 169 with 舊 plus samples of 原, 前 and 老). Each modifier’s mean vector was subtracted inside the training folds, so the probe reads differences between contexts of the same word, not the word itself.',
