 '終點':'Finish','換你來填':'Your turn',
 '跟著小張走過三十年職場，看 BERT 在哪一幕跟不上故事；或者直接挑戰真實語料題。你能比 BERT 更會選嗎？從真實語料抽題，先選再揭曉語料原字與 BERT 的答案。課堂上可用「主持模式」讓全班一起和 BERT 對決。':'Follow Xiao Zhang through thirty years at work and see where BERT loses the plot — or take on real corpus sentences. Can you choose better than BERT? Pick first, then see the original word and BERT’s answer. In class, “host mode” lets the whole room play against BERT.',
