 '語料顯示：<span class="m 原">原</span>九成、<span class="m 前">前</span>近八成接職務角色；<span class="m 舊">舊</span>七成接關係角色。先掌握名詞類型，就能預測大部分的搭配。':`In the corpus about 90% of ${M('原')} and nearly 80% of ${M('前')} go with position roles; 70% of ${M('舊')} go with relational roles. Know the noun type and you can predict most collocations.`,
 '在黑板畫時間線，「現在」打一條直線：<span class="m 前">前</span>、<span class="m 原">原</span>停在線的左邊；<span class="m 老">老</span>可以停在左邊，也可以一路畫過現在。':`Draw a timeline with a vertical line at “now”: ${M('前')} and ${M('原')} stop to the left of it; ${M('老')} can stop on the left or run right through “now”.`
